// SOURCE: examples/gpu/mandelbulb/main.vl
// REQUIRES: metal
// LINK: std::gpu and std::window name the frameworks they link
// The native event loop without a display (std::window's script). Pause
// the automatic rotation, switch to orchid, disable shadows and drag the
// camera; the shot checks the result of all four events.
// ENV: VOLE_WINDOW_SCRIPT=size 640x400; key space; key c; key c; key s; press left 200 200; move 260 220; release left 260 220; frames 2; shot mandelbulb-script-test.ppm; frames 1
// EXPECT-PPM: mandelbulb-script-test.ppm tests/golden/gpu-mandelbulb-script.ppm region 160,100,320,200 tolerance 12 allow 3%
